Assignment Overview:

Goal: create optimized dynamic programming algorithm for creating the max value of common subsequence in 2 strings.

Input file:
First line - number of characters in the alphabet being used (k)
K lines after - letter and value of aligning that letter, space in between
Line after - string A
Line after - String B

Input file example:
3
a 2
b 4
c 5
aacb
caab

Output file:
First line - max value of common subsequence
Second line - the subsequence itself.

Example output file:
9
cb

Running program.
Go clone into folder
Change input file.
Build: g++ main.cpp -o main.exe
Execute: ./main.exe 
View output in output file.


